            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="py-8">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-normal text-[var(--color-text-primary-paper)] mb-3">
              Do shades integrate with Lutron lighting scenes, or run independently?
            </h3>
            <p class="text-base text-[var(--color-text-secondary-paper)] leading-relaxed">
              They're part of the same architecture — a "Movie" scene can lower shades and dim lights together in one action, and a "Good Morning" scene can raise shades on schedule, all triggered from the same keypad or app as the rest of the lighting system.
